  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "REST Controller Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "REST Controller Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What @RestController Is",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@RestController` = `@Controller` + `@ResponseBody`",
                "Every return value is ==written to the body== by an HttpMessageConverter",
                "{red:Never} resolved as a view name"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Request Flow",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "DispatcherServlet",
                    "sub": "front door",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HandlerMapping",
                    "sub": "finds method",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HandlerAdapter",
                    "sub": "binds arguments",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Your method",
                    "sub": "runs",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HttpMessageConverter",
                    "sub": "result to body",
                    "ink": "pink"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mapping and Thin Controller",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@RestController",
                "@RequestMapping(\"/api/users\")",
                "class UserController {",
                "  private final UserService svc;",
                "  @GetMapping(\"/{id}\")",
                "  UserDto get(@PathVariable Long id) {",
                "    return svc.find(id); }",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "class prefix + method shortcut"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Class-level `@RequestMapping` sets the ==prefix==",
                "`@GetMapping` `@PostMapping` `@PutMapping` `@PatchMapping` `@DeleteMapping` = `@RequestMapping(method=...)`",
                "Thin: parse and validate input, ==delegate to a service==, return **DTOs**"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Rules",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Singleton beans",
              "items": [
                "One controller instance serves all requests",
                "No per-request state in fields",
                "Return DTOs, not JPA entities: API shape stays decoupled from the DB schema"
              ],
              "ink": "red"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Request Mapping, Path Variables and Query Params",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Request Mapping, Path Variables and Query Params",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Binding the URL",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@GetMapping(\"/{id}\")` + `@PathVariable Long id` binds the ==URI segment==",
                "Name must match the placeholder, else `@PathVariable(\"id\")`",
                "`@RequestParam String q` reads `?q=...`",
                "{red:Required by default}: a missing param gives ==400==",
                "Relax with `required=false` or `defaultValue=\"10\"`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Missing Values and Mismatches",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Missing param",
                "Result"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`String`, required (default)",
                  "{red:400}"
                ],
                [
                  "`int`, `required=true` (default)",
                  "{red:400} `MissingServletRequestParameterException`"
                ],
                [
                  "`int`, `required=false`",
                  "{red:500} `IllegalStateException`: null into a primitive"
                ],
                [
                  "`Integer`, `Optional<T>` or `defaultValue`",
                  "{green:OK}, optional"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Narrow the mapping",
                "Mismatch"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`consumes = \"application/json\"`",
                  "Wrong Content-Type → ==415=="
                ],
                [
                  "`produces = \"application/json\"`",
                  "Unacceptable Accept → ==406=="
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Example",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Path, query and header each bind with their own annotation",
                "`@RequestHeader` is required too: missing gives 400"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@GetMapping(\"/users/{id}/orders\")",
                "public List<OrderDto> list(",
                "    @PathVariable Long id,",
                "    @RequestParam(defaultValue=\"0\") int page,",
                "    @RequestHeader(\"X-Trace\") String t)"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Primitive trap",
              "text": "Primitive with no value: ==400== if required, ==500== if `required=false`. Use `Integer` or `defaultValue`."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Request Bodies and Bean Validation",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Request Bodies and Bean Validation",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Body to DTO and Failures",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@RequestBody`: ==Jackson== maps the JSON body to a DTO",
                "`@Valid` (or `@Validated`) before it runs ==Bean Validation==, before the method body"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "JSON body",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Jackson",
                    "sub": "bad JSON: 400",
                    "ink": "red"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "@Valid",
                    "sub": "invalid: 400",
                    "ink": "red"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Method runs",
                    "ink": "green"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Failure",
                "Exception",
                "Status"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Malformed JSON",
                  "`HttpMessageNotReadableException`",
                  "400"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Valid` body",
                  "`MethodArgumentNotValidException`",
                  "400"
                ],
                [
                  "Param, Spring 6.1+",
                  "`HandlerMethodValidationException`",
                  "400"
                ],
                [
                  "Param, class `@Validated`",
                  "`ConstraintViolationException`",
                  "500 unless handled"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Constraints on DTO Fields",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Annotation",
                "Rejects"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@NotNull`",
                  "null"
                ],
                [
                  "`@NotEmpty`",
                  "null or empty"
                ],
                [
                  "`@NotBlank`",
                  "null, empty, spaces only"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Size` `@Min` `@Max`",
                  "length or range breaches"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Email` `@Pattern`",
                  "bad format, regex mismatch"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Example",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "record CreateUser(",
                "  @NotBlank String name,",
                "  @Email String email,",
                "  @Min(18) int age) {}",
                "",
                "@PostMapping",
                "ResponseEntity<UserDto> create(",
                "  @Valid @RequestBody CreateUser req)"
              ],
              "note": "missing @Valid: constraints silently skipped"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "400 vs 422",
              "text": "Spring's default for `MethodArgumentNotValidException` is ==400==. 422 is a deliberate choice in a custom handler."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "ResponseEntity and Status Codes",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "ResponseEntity and Status Codes",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What ResponseEntity Controls",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`ResponseEntity<T>` = ==status + headers + body== in one object",
                "Return a plain object → status is always ==200==",
                "`@ResponseStatus(HttpStatus.CREATED)` sets one **fixed** status",
                "Status varies at runtime → use `ResponseEntity`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Builders",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Builder",
                "Status"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`ResponseEntity.ok(body)`",
                  "200"
                ],
                [
                  "`ResponseEntity.status(HttpStatus.CREATED).body(x)`",
                  "201"
                ],
                [
                  "`ResponseEntity.noContent().build()`",
                  "204"
                ],
                [
                  "`ResponseEntity.notFound().build()`",
                  "404"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Create → ==201 + Location== header pointing at the new resource"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "return ResponseEntity",
                "    .created(URI.create(\"/api/users/\" + id))",
                "    .body(dto);"
              ],
              "note": "201 with Location: /api/users/{id}"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Status Conventions",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Case",
                "Status"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "GET",
                  "{green:200}"
                ],
                [
                  "POST (create)",
                  "{green:201}"
                ],
                [
                  "PUT / PATCH",
                  "{green:200}"
                ],
                [
                  "DELETE",
                  "{green:204}"
                ],
                [
                  "Bad input",
                  "{red:400}"
                ],
                [
                  "Missing",
                  "{red:404}"
                ],
                [
                  "Conflict",
                  "{red:409}"
                ],
                [
                  "Validation",
                  "{red:422} or {red:400}"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "Fixed status → `@ResponseStatus`. Runtime choice, headers or `Location` → ==ResponseEntity==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Exception Handling and Content Negotiation",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Exception Handling and Content Negotiation",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Global Error Handlers",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{red:@RestControllerAdvice} = `@ControllerAdvice` + `@ResponseBody`: global handlers",
                "`@ControllerAdvice` alone needs `@ResponseBody` on **each** handler",
                "`@ExceptionHandler(UserNotFoundException.class)` → `ResponseEntity<ErrorResponse>` with ==404==",
                "The ==most specific== exception type wins"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@ExceptionHandler(MethodArgumentNotValidException.class)",
                "ResponseEntity<Map<String,String>> invalid(MethodArgumentNotValidException ex) {",
                "  Map<String,String> m = new HashMap<>();",
                "  ex.getBindingResult().getFieldErrors()",
                "    .forEach(f -> m.put(f.getField(), f.getDefaultMessage()));",
                "  return ResponseEntity.badRequest().body(m);",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "field → message map"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Simple Mapping and Standard Body",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Option",
                "Use for"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@ResponseStatus(NOT_FOUND)` on exception class",
                  "Simple fixed mapping"
                ],
                [
                  "`ProblemDetail` (RFC 7807)",
                  "Built-in standard error body, ==Spring 6+=="
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Content Negotiation",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Accept header",
                    "sub": "+ produces",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Pick converter",
                    "sub": "HttpMessageConverter",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Write body",
                    "sub": "JSON by default",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "No match",
                    "sub": "406",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "JSON via ==Jackson== is the default",
                "XML needs `jackson-dataformat-xml` on the classpath"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "text": "Why prefer @RestControllerAdvice? One place for all errors. Which handler wins? The most specific type. When does 406 occur? No converter matches Accept."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
